{"id":50639,"date":"2026-04-14T07:25:22","date_gmt":"2026-04-14T06:25:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50639"},"modified":"2026-09-04T18:16:47","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T17:16:47","slug":"aquae-brunheiro-trail-running","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/aquae-brunheiro-trail-running\/","title":{"rendered":"Aquae Brunheiro Trail Running 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Aquae Brunheiro Trail Running 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Aquae Brunheiro Trail Running 2026<\/strong> chega \u00e0 sua 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o nos dias <strong>19 e 20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, desafiando-te a explorar a majestosa e aut\u00eantica <strong>Serra do Brunheiro<\/strong> em <strong>Chaves<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Vila Real<\/strong>. Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Lobos do Brunheiro de Chaves<\/strong> e apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Chaves<\/strong>, a partida oficial tem lugar na t\u00edpica aldeia de <strong>Vilar de Nantes<\/strong>, conduzindo os atletas pelos trilhos t\u00e9cnicos e paisagens soberbas de Tr\u00e1s-os-Montes at\u00e9 \u00e0 consagradora linha de meta na hist\u00f3rica cidade termal de Chaves.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento disponibiliza um leque completo de dist\u00e2ncias competitivas pontu\u00e1veis para os <strong>Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP<\/strong> (Ultra Trail, Trail, Trail Sprint e Trail Jovem) e certificadas com pontua\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>ITRA e UTMB Index<\/strong>. Podes escolher entre o <strong>Ultra Trail (48 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Longo (30 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto (21 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail (12 km)<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada (12 km)<\/strong> ou o <strong>Kids Trail<\/strong> no s\u00e1bado para os mais novos, usufruindo de servi\u00e7o de autocarro para a partida e do tradicional almo\u00e7o transmontano de conv\u00edvio ap\u00f3s a supera\u00e7\u00e3o da montanha.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; f