=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/05)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 18.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:40<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/05)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Trail<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/09 (50 vagas))<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Aquae Brunheiro Trail Running 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre nos dias 19 e 20 de setembro de 2026. No s\u00e1bado, dia 19, realiza-se o Kids Trail em Vilar de Nantes. No domingo, dia 20, decorrem as partidas do Ultra Trail, Trail Longo, Trail Curto, Mini Trail e Caminhada a partir da Junta de Freguesia de Vilar de Nantes, com meta final na cidade de Chaves, distrito de Vila Real.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e percursos dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui cinco dist\u00e2ncias para todos os n\u00edveis: Ultra Trail de 48 km, Trail Longo de 30 km, Trail Curto de 21 km, Mini Trail de 12 km, Caminhada de 12 km e o Kids Trail (com percursos entre 500m e 2000m para crian\u00e7as dos 3 aos 16 anos).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o transporte para o ponto de partida e o almo\u00e7o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte em autocarro no domingo entre a cidade de Chaves (junto ao Hotel Premium) e a partida em Vilar de Nantes para todos os atletas inscritos. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui ainda o almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio servido a partir das 12:30 em Chaves (exceto no Kids Trail).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As provas pontuam para os circuitos da ATRP e rankings internacionais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. O Ultra Trail, Trail Longo, Trail Curto e Mini Trail integram os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running de Portugal), contam com pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para os rankings ITRA e UTMB Index e pontuam para o circuito regional da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Vila Real.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e como posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e levantar o dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma oficial Stop and Go at\u00e9 13 de setembro de 2026, com pre\u00e7os bonificados em tr\u00eas fases. O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado entre as 14:00 e as 20:00 e no domingo das 06:30 \u00e0s 08:30 para levantamento de dorsais e kits de atleta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Aquae Brunheiro Trail Running 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia de Vilar de Nantes\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Chaves\", \"addressRegion\": \"Vila Real\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Lobos do Brunheiro de Chaves\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Aquae Brunheiro Trail Running 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre nos dias 19 e 20 de setembro de 2026. No s\u00e1bado, dia 19, realiza-se o Kids Trail em Vilar de Nantes. No domingo, dia 20, decorrem as partidas do Ultra Trail, Trail Longo, Trail Curto, Mini Trail e Caminhada a partir da Junta de Freguesia de Vilar de Nantes, com meta final na cidade de Chaves, distrito de Vila Real.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e percursos dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui cinco dist\u00e2ncias para todos os n\u00edveis: Ultra Trail de 48 km, Trail Longo de 30 km, Trail Curto de 21 km, Mini Trail de 12 km, Caminhada de 12 km e o Kids Trail (com percursos entre 500m e 2000m para crian\u00e7as dos 3 aos 16 anos).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o transporte para o ponto de partida e o almo\u00e7o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte em autocarro no domingo entre a cidade de Chaves (junto ao Hotel Premium) e a partida em Vilar de Nantes para todos os atletas inscritos. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui ainda o almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio servido a partir das 12:30 em Chaves (exceto no Kids Trail).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"As provas pontuam para os circuitos da ATRP e rankings internacionais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. O Ultra Trail, Trail Longo, Trail Curto e Mini Trail integram os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running de Portugal), contam com pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para os rankings ITRA e UTMB Index e pontuam para o circuito regional da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Vila Real.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e como posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e levantar o dorsal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma oficial Stop and Go at\u00e9 13 de setembro de 2026, com pre\u00e7os bonificados em tr\u00eas fases. O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado entre as 14:00 e as 20:00 e no domingo das 06:30 \u00e0s 08:30 para levantamento de dorsais e kits de atleta.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66756,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498,499],"event_type_2":[726,820,64],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-50639","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-chaves-vila-real","e